<h5 class="activityhead" id="A217">Arduino on Proteus </h5>
<p class="paraactivity">The workshop on “Arduino on Proteus” was held in seminar hall of the AD block (AD319) Mr Maneesh T. (staff Coordinator), Archa Mohan(S5T1), Bhagya.S (S5T1), Biby Thomas (S5T1) coordinated the class. The workshop was from 9:00AM to 4:00PM 22 students from various departments attended the workshop.
The workshop covered the areas Basic proteus functions Basic Arduino Programming Adding library to Proteus Doing Arduino in Proteus </p>


